# Jira Workflow Status Names (Regex)
NEXT_PUBLIC_JIRA_STATUS_TODO="To Do|Backlog|Open|New|Ready"
NEXT_PUBLIC_JIRA_STATUS_IN_PROGRESS="In Progress|Doing|Dev|In Review"
NEXT_PUBLIC_JIRA_STATUS_DONE="Done|Complete|Resolved|Finished"
